          "links": [],
          "data": {
            "kind": "QueryGroup",
            "spec": {
              "queries": [],
              "transformations": [],
              "queryOptions": {}
            }
          },
          "vizConfig": {
            "kind": "VizConfig",
            "group": "text",
            "version": "",
            "spec": {
              "options": {
                "mode": "markdown",
                "content": "**TODO** — панель станет живой, когда метрики получат статус «есть» в [инвентаре](https://github.com/batazor/nomnom/blob/main/docs/observability/metric-inventory.md).\n\n| Метрика | Статус для `bff` |\n| --- | --- |\n| [`router_http_requests_total`](https://github.com/batazor/nomnom/blob/main/docs/observability/metric-inventory.md#graphql) | ожидается |\n| [`target_info`](https://github.com/batazor/nomnom/blob/main/docs/observability/metric-inventory.md#resource) | ожидается |\n\nЦелевой PromQL:\n\n```promql\nsum(rate(router_http_requests_total{job=~\"nomnom/(${service:pipe})\", instance=~\"$service_instance\", wg_subgraph_name=\"\"}[$__rate_interval]) and on (job, instance) target_info{job=~\"nomnom/(${service:pipe})\", deployment_environment_name=~\"$environment\", service_version=~\"$version\"})\n```\n"
              },
              "fieldConfig": {
                "defaults": {},
                "overrides": []
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
